        },
        {
          "text": "Now Adam knew Eve his wife, and she conceived and bore Cain, saying, “I have gotten",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4.1",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Heb",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "qanah,",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "get",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " a man with the help of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ".” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And again, she bore his brother Abel. Now Abel was a keeper of sheep, and Cain a tiller of the ground. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In the course of time Cain brought to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " an offering of the fruit of the ground, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.11.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Heb 11.4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " and Abel brought of the firstlings of his flock and of their fat portions. And the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " had regard for Abel and his offering, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "but for Cain and his offering he had no regard. So Cain was very angry, and his countenance fell. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said to Cain, “Why are you angry, and why has your countenance fallen? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If you do well, will you not be accepted? And if you do not do well, sin is couching at the door; its desire is for you, but you must master it.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
