                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Cain said to Abel his brother, “Let us go out to the field.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4.8",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Sam Gk Syr Compare Vg: Heb lacks",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Let us go out to the field",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " And when they were in the field, Cain rose up against his brother Abel, and killed him. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said to Cain, “Where is Abel your brother?” He said, “I do not know; am I my brother's keeper?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said, “What have you done? The voice of your brother's blood is crying to me from the ground. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And now you are cursed from the ground, which has opened its mouth to receive your brother's blood from your hand. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When you till the ground, it shall no longer yield to you its strength; you shall be a fugitive and a wanderer on the earth.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cain said to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", “My punishment is greater than I can bear. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Behold, thou hast driven me this day away from the ground; and from thy face I shall be hidden; and I shall be a fugitive and a wanderer on the earth, and whoever finds me will slay me.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said to him, “Not so!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4.15",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Gk Syr Vg: Heb",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Therefore",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " If any one slays Cain, vengeance shall be taken on him sevenfold.” And the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " put a mark on Cain, lest any who came upon him should kill him. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Cain went away from the presence of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", and dwelt in the land of Nod,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4.16",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "That is",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Wandering",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " east of Eden.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.4.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
